    {
      "tag": "H1",
      "text": "Magal Solutions Ranked #1 in Duns 100",
      "font": "\"Open Sans\"",
      "size": "31.6875px",
      "weight": "800",
      "color": "rgb(0, 37, 205)"
    },
    {
      "tag": "P",
      "text": "Magal Solutions has been ranked #1 in the Homeland Security (HLS) category of the 2026 Dun’s 100 Defense Industry ranking.",
      "font": "\"Open Sans\"",
      "size": "19.5px",
      "weight": "400",
      "color": "rgb(37, 37, 37)"
    },
    {
      "tag": "P",
      "text": "Published by Dun & Bradstreet, the new ranking maps 60 companies across six areas of Israel’s defense industry, including defense integration, manufacturing, unmanned and autonomous systems, homeland security, intelligence and cyber, and tactical equipment.",
      "font": "\"Open Sans\"",
      "size": "19.5px",
      "weight": "400",
      "color": "rgb(37, 37, 37)"
    },
    {
      "tag": "P",
      "text": "The ranking considers a combination of quantitative and qualitative factors, including business strength, technological innovation, international activity, position within the defense value chain and operational relevance.",
      "font": "\"Open Sans\"",
      "size": "19.5px",
      "weight": "400",
      "color": "rgb(37, 37, 37)"
    },
    {
      "tag": "P",
      "text": "The launch of the ranking received coverage across leading Israeli business, technology and defense media outlets, all of which highlighted Magal’s #1 position in the Homeland Security category.",
      "font": "\"Open Sans\"",
      "size": "19.5px",
      "weight": "400",
      "color": "rgb(37, 37, 37)"
    },
    {
      "tag": "H2",
      "text": "In the Media",
      "font": "Jura",
      "size": "26.8125px",
      "weight": "700",
      "color": "rgb(0, 37, 205)"
    },
    {
      "tag": "P",
      "text": "",
      "font": "\"Open Sans\"",
      "size": "19.5px",
      "weight": "400",
      "color": "rgb(37, 37, 37)"
    },
    {
      "tag": "P",
      "text": "The Jerusalem Post\nDuns 100 maps 60 firms driving Israel’s defense-tech transformation\nThe Jerusalem Post examines the new ranking and the broader shift toward an Israeli Defense-Tech ecosystem, identifying Magal among the companies leading their respective categories.\nRead the article",
      "font": "\"Open Sans\"",
      "size": "19.5px",
      "weight": "400",
      "color": "rgb(37, 37, 37)"
    },
    {
      "tag": "P",
      "text": "",
      "font": "\"Open Sans\"",
      "size": "19.5px",
      "weight": "400",
      "color": "rgb(37, 37, 37)"
    },
    {
      "tag": "P",
      "text": "Israel’s Economy Channel: Channel 10\nThe next leap? The list revealing Israel’s leading defense companies\nChannel 10 provides a breakdown of the six ranking categories, naming Magal as the #1 company in Homeland Security.\nRead the article",
      "font": "\"Open Sans\"",
      "size": "19.5px",
      "weight": "400",
      "color": "rgb(37, 37, 37)"
    },
    {
      "tag": "P",
      "text": "",
      "font": "\"Open Sans\"",
      "size": "19.5px",
      "weight": "400",
      "color": "rgb(37, 37, 37)"
    },
    {
      "tag": "P",
      "text": "Geektime\nFor the first time: A ranking of Israel’s leading defense companies\nGeektime covers the inaugural Duns100 ranking and the companies shaping Israel’s expanding Defense-Tech sector.\nRead the article",
      "font": "\"Open Sans\"",
      "size": "19.5px",
      "weight": "400",
      "color": "rgb(37, 37, 37)"
    },
    {
      "tag": "P",
      "text": "",
      "font": "\"Open Sans\"",
      "size": "19.5px",
      "weight": "400",
      "color": "rgb(37, 37, 37)"
    },
    {
      "tag": "P",
      "text": "N12\nFor the first time: These are the companies leading Israel’s defense industry\nN12 reports on the companies heading each of the six Duns100 categories, with Magal leading the Homeland Security category.\nRead the article",
      "font": "\"Open Sans\"",
      "size": "19.5px",
      "weight": "400",
      "color": "rgb(37, 37, 37)"
    }
  ],
